    <description>DiskGeek scans your drives and shows exactly what is eating your space, with both a
list view and a treemap view of disk usage.

* Find exact duplicates, and near-duplicates using perceptual hashing, including similar images
* Full-text search across scan results
* Snapshot comparison, so you can see what changed between scans over time
* Batch rename
* Scheduled scans for ongoing monitoring

No installer bloat, no bundled offers and no telemetry. Free at home and at work, with no Pro
tier, no per-seat licence and no upsells.

Built on Avalonia and .NET 8. The runtime is self-contained, so there is nothing to install
beforehand.</description>
    <summary>Free disk space analyser for Windows with treemap, duplicate detection and scheduled scans</summary>
